# The envelope page (opz_drumenv, engine-abi.md §3): kick a full hit (0 / 0 / 255 / 0, as the presets); snare held
# to an eighth (sustain 32) and cut; perc cut at once (sustain 0) with a fade (release 100); sample a swell (decay 80)
# started late (attack 96), in gate style (note style 160): released after one step, it fades out within ~20 ms.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 6
track kick
note 0 F3 1 100
note 8 A3 1 100
track snare
param sustain 32
note 0 F3 1 100
note 8 A3 1 100
track perc
param sustain 0
param release 100
note 0 F3 1 100
note 8 A3 1 100
track sample
param attack 96
param decay 80
param note_style 160
note 0 F3 1 100
note 8 A3 4 100
expect sound 0 2
expect peak_below 0
expect idle 160
